},{"id":"migration_00028_save_credentials","label":"Migration 00028: save_gateway_credentials_secure","file_type":"code","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00028_save_credentials_with_key.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"migration_00029_fix_crypto","label":"Migration 00029: Fix pgcrypto Schema Qualification","file_type":"code","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00029_fix_crypto_schema.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"claude_md","label":"CLAUDE.md Project Instructions","file_type":"document","source_file":"CLAUDE.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"readme_md","label":"README.md","file_type":"document","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"operating_models_md","label":"OPERATING_MODELS.md: Cascading State Protocol","file_type":"document","source_file":"docs/implementation/OPERATING_MODELS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"pending_tasks_md","label":"PENDING_TASKS.md","file_type":"document","source_file":"docs/implementation/PENDING_TASKS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"plan_actual_md","label":"PLAN_ACTUAL.md (PT-FIX-019)","file_type":"document","source_file":"docs/implementation/PLAN_ACTUAL.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"session_summary_md","label":"SESSION_SUMMARY.md","file_type":"document","source_file":"docs/implementation/SESSION_SUMMARY.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"concept_cascading_state_protocol","label":"Cascading State Protocol (ACK-gated workflow)","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"docs/implementation/OPERATING_MODELS.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Prevents AI from autonomously advancing phases without explicit user ACK. Ensures auditability and prevents runaway code generation. Each phase produces a single document artifact: SESSION_SUMMARY → PLAN_ACTUAL → PENDING_TASKS → HISTORY.log."},{"id":"concept_pgcrypto_schema_fix","label":"pgcrypto extensions.* Schema Qualification Fix","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00029_fix_crypto_schema.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"PostgREST v12 sets search_path=public per transaction. SECURITY DEFINER functions without SET search_path inherit caller search_path. pgcrypto is installed in schema 'extensions', not 'public', so pgp_sym_encrypt/decrypt are unreachable at runtime via PostgREST. Fix: fully qualify all pgcrypto calls with extensions. prefix instead of altering search_path globally."},{"id":"concept_mfa_rls_claim","label":"mfa_verified JWT Claim as RLS Gate","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00015_storage_hardening.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"app_metadata.mfa_verified:true is immutable by the user (only service_role can set it). RLS policies check this claim via auth.jwt()->'user_metadata'->>'mfa_verified' to enforce MFA for vendor write operations. This is the binding security contract between the auth layer and the data layer."},{"id":"concept_toggling_guard","label":"_toggling Guard Pattern (Double-Fire Prevention)","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"apps/vendor-admin/src/pages/settings/index.astro","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Alpine.js x-for re-renders can cause @change inside <label> to fire twice due to synthetic click propagation. Adding a _toggling flag prevents duplicate POST requests when toggling a checkbox within a wrapping <label>."},{"id":"concept_auth_jwt_selfhosted","label":"auth.jwt() Self-Hosted Polyfill","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00000b_auth_helpers.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Supabase Cloud auto-provisions auth.jwt(). The Docker self-hosted image supabase/postgres:15.8.1.032 does not include it. Migration 00000b defines it as CREATE OR REPLACE before any migration that references it, using lexicographic ordering (00000_ < 00000b_) to guarantee it runs first."},{"id":"concept_vendor_mfa_auth_flow","label":"Vendor MFA First-Login Flow","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Enforces: login → forced password change (profiles.password_changed_at IS NULL) → TOTP setup (totp_enabled=false) → TOTP verify (mfa_verified claim). All three steps must complete before RLS unlocks vendor data access."},{"id":"fn_save_gateway_credentials_secure","label":"save_gateway_credentials_secure (PL/pgSQL)","file_type":"code","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00028_save_credentials_with_key.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"fn_save_payment_credentials","label":"save_payment_credentials (PL/pgSQL)","file_type":"code","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00029_fix_crypto_schema.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"fn_get_payment_credentials","label":"get_payment_credentials (PL/pgSQL)","file_type":"code","source_file":"supabase/migrations/00029_fix_crypto_schema.sql","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"fn_auth_jwt","label":"auth.jwt() PostgreSQL Function","